    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match cards by pairing face-up cards in your hand with cards on the field, similar to the memory game concentration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching cards = playing cards (equivalent to the card-playing action in typical card games)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your turn ends after 3 failed matching attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With good luck and memory, you can take multiple actions per turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take damage each time you fail to match cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have effects just by being placed on the field, or activate effects without needing to be matched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based system where you and the enemy alternate actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce the enemy's HP to 0 before you are defeated</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match cards by pairing face-up cards in your hand with cards on the field, similar to the memory game concentration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching cards = playing cards (equivalent to the card-playing action in typical card games)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your turn ends after 3 failed matching attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With good luck and memory, you can take multiple actions per turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take damage each time you fail to match cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have effects just by being placed on the field, or activate effects without needing to be matched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based system where you and the enemy alternate actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce the enemy's HP to 0 before you are defeated</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Memory meets deck-building in this addictive roguelike! Simple rules, instant fun - match memorized cards for satisfying battles. Perfect balance of memory and luck gives everyone a winning chance. No complex mechanics, just pure card battle enjoyment you can play anytime!",
